  Run `opera-browser-cli fill @.5 "text"` to fill the "Text input" field
  Run `opera-browser-cli click @.25` to click the "File input" button
  Run `opera-browser-cli click @.14` to click the "Return to index" link
  Run `opera-browser-cli scroll down` to scroll down
  Use `opera-browser-cli eval <expr>` for JS expressions. For multi-statement code, wrap in an IIFE: `eval "(() => { ...; return result })()"`

